 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "So that + subjunctive",
     "texto": [
      "When the subject changes, use **para que** + subjunctive: **Vou ligar-te cedo, para que tenhas tempo** (I'll call you early so that you have time).",
      "**a fim de que** (in order that) also exists, more formal: **a fim de que possamos decidir** (in order that we can decide)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Para» + infinitive",
     "texto": [
      "With the same subject, use **para** + infinitive: **Estudo para passar no exame** (I study to pass the exam). If the subject changes, besides **para que** + subjunctive, it is possible to use the inflected infinitive: **Falei baixo para as crianças não acordarem** (I spoke quietly so that the children wouldn't wake up).",
      "Don't use **para que passe** if you are the one who is studying."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
